<h1>Confirm your email address</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.first_name.presence || @user.email %>,</p>

<p>Thanks for signing up. Please confirm your email address by submitting the token below:</p>

<p>
  <strong>Token:</strong> <code><%= @raw_token %></code>
</p>

<p>POST to <code>/api/v1/auth/confirm</code> with <code>{ "token": "&lt;token&gt;" }</code></p>

<p>This token expires in 24 hours. If you did not create an account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
